  "prefLabel": "He-C 403.03 Notice of the Public Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 403.03 Notice of the Public Hearing.\n\n(a) Notice of a public hearing shall be provided:\n\n(1) On the board’s website at www.dhhs.nh.gov/tcmob; and\n\n(2) At least 10 calendar days in advance of the hearing.\n\n(b) The notice in (a) above shall include, at a minimum:\n\n(1) The date, time, and location of the hearing;\n\n(2) The reason for the hearing, including the specific medical condition(s) under consideration; and\n\n(3) The date that the written comment period shall close, which shall be at least 5 business days after the hearing.\n\nSource. #12947, eff 12-20-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c400.html"
